  "description": "Standalone rate-limiting admin UI for CrudApi-based platforms — per-database, per-credential CRUD traffic limits with a Global Admin / Tenant Admin view, independent login, and a signed auto-login handoff from CrudAdmin. v1.1.0 adds per-IP, global-per-database, and tenant-aggregate scopes plus daily/monthly/custom quota windows with auto-reset, layered on top of the original per-credential burst limit. Own SQLite/MySQL storage; no dependency on WebSvc.CrudAdmin's assembly.",
